   {
    "title": "AdExchange Platform.",
    "description": "Project Description \n\nAdExchange Platform which connects the producers of high-quality video content with the publishers of premium, targeted websites, Mobile Apps through a content distribution network platform.\n\nRole : Lead \n\nDesigned and developed a high performance auto scaling AdExchange Engine based on a robust architecture rooted on Node JS and using CI/CD pipeline also built a reporting and analytic system to aggregate, transform, and analyze server logs and exchange reports.The AdExchange Engine generates large volumes of log data that can offer vital insight into the performance of systems, and the effectiveness of bidding, Ad monetization, and ad revenue optimization. \n",
    "dateRange": {},
    "associatedWith": ""
   },
   {
    "title": "OTT Platform",
    "description": "Project Description \n\nGizmott is a complete OTT platform with Mobile and TV Apps, Website, Subscription Management, Ad Monetization, Live streaming, and Analytics.\n\nRole :Lead \n\nBuilt an AES encryption based transcoding system which enables videos to stream smoothly in various OTT devices and a scalable live channel engine by stitching HLS VOD's together and also by using Media Server . \n\nTechnologies : \nNodeJS,Express,Redis,FFMPEG,Wowza Media Server,Kue Priority.",
